msgstr "سر whsec_… لنقطة webhook تشير إلى %s (الأحداث: checkout.session.completed وcheckout.session.expired وcheckout.session.async_payment_succeeded وcheckout.session.async_payment_failed وpayment_intent.payment_failed وcharge.refunded وrefund.failed)."

#: includes/gateway/class-xpay-gateway.php:145
